cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If using this reproduction, please cite the archived version once a Zenodo DOI is available."
type: software
title: "When Simultaneous Switching Underestimates RC-Grid Droop: A Validated EM-IR Audit"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible numerical and native-tool counterexample to a source-specific
  strict-upper-bound assertion about simultaneous switching in an open-source
  power-distribution-network analyzer. Includes analytic derivation, ngspice
  comparison, synthetic fixtures and a documentation/regression patch.
  No new general verification algorithm or silicon failure is claimed.
authors:
